Ciot
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 101 DEAL EROUN
EROUN 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE EROUN EROUN
OR
    SRC Rank K
    AND
        DESTSRC Suit match
        DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK EROUN EROUN
DEST Empty
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL EROUN Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL EROUN Empty
        PILE ALL EROUN Empty
